" for control (Chx) and set its RCx_OPTION to the appropriate Relay (1-6) "
"that you had set its pin parameter above."
msgstr ""
"将某个 RELAYx_PIN 设置为 「81」来控制切换。然后选择一个 RC 通道（Chx）并将其 RCx_OPTION "
"设置为上面设置了引脚参数的对应继电器（1-6）。"

